{"diagnosis": "NOP fetch (ADDI x0,x0,0, opcode 0010011) ends in `TRAP: cpu trap asserted` and `FAIL 0xdead` at CYCLES=2009 instead of clean progress. `is_alu_reg_imm` stays 0 when it should be 1, so OP-IMM never decodes. Root cause in picorv32.v:877 compares `mem_rdata_latched[6:0]` to 7'b0010010 instead of 7'b0010011, off by one LSB. CONE_SLICE picosoc/picosoc.v:134-146 only shows cpu instantiation (fallback-window, 0/1 resolved) and does not cover the decoder, so trace wins.", "patch_diff": "diff --git a/picorv32.v b/picorv32.v
--- a/picorv32.v
+++ b/picorv32.v
@@ -874,7 +874,7 @@
 			is_beq_bne_blt_bge_bltu_bgeu <= mem_rdata_latched[6:0] == 7'b1100011;
 			is_lb_lh_lw_lbu_lhu          <= mem_rdata_latched[6:0] == 7'b0000011;
 			is_sb_sh_sw                  <= mem_rdata_latched[6:0] == 7'b0100011;
-			is_alu_reg_imm               <= mem_rdata_latched[6:0] == 7'b0010010;
+			is_alu_reg_imm               <= mem_rdata_latched[6:0] == 7'b0010011;
 			is_alu_reg_reg               <= mem_rdata_latched[6:0] == 7'b0110011;
", "expected": "tohost PASS with no TRAP: cpu trap asserted, fetch progress beyond CYCLES=2009"}

